# Audi A4 B5 four-door saloon, 1995-2001.
#
# The first A4, replacing the 80: 4,476 mm long, 1,733 mm wide, 1,415 mm high,
# 2,615 mm wheelbase; 1.6-2.8 petrol and 1.9 TDI, front-wheel drive or quattro.
# Facelift in 1999. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A4
#
# Colours: Brilliant Black, Silver Metallic, Ming Blue and Brilliant Red are
# period Audi finishes.
#
# Weight: 200 in total (black 60, silver 60, blue 50, red 30).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 115/350 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1995-2001 with a road tail to about 2010.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a4-b5.blend. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a4-b5/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

